---
import ContentPageLayout from '../../layouts/ContentPageLayout.astro';
import SectionHeader from '../../components/SectionHeader.astro';
import FeatureItem from '../../components/FeatureItem.astro';
---

<ContentPageLayout
  title="Who We Are"
  description="Learn about Fighting Smart Cyber - an operator-led cybersecurity company founded by proven leaders with TS/SCI-level operational experience."
  heroTitle='Who <span class="highlight">We Are</span>'
  heroSubtitle="Operator-led offensive and defensive cyber solutions from proven cyber operations leaders"
  ctaTitle="Let's Build Your Smart Solution"
  ctaDescription="Tell us about your mission and we'll design a solution that fits."
  ctaPrimaryButton={{ text: 'Get in Touch', href: '/contact' }}
  ctaSecondaryButton={{ text: 'Meet Our Leadership', href: '/about/leadership' }}
>
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="content-with-illustration">
        <div class="content-text">
          <h2>Operator-Led.<br>Practitioner-First.</h2>
          <p>Fighting Smart Cyber was founded by three proven cyber operations leaders with decades of combined experience conducting offensive and defensive cyber operations at the highest classification levels.</p>
          <p>We're not career theorists. We're operators who've designed, built, and run cyber capabilities in production. Our team includes a retired three-star general with cyber and operational command experience, a senior officer with deep <span class="tooltip-trigger">DCO<span class="tooltip-inline">Defensive Cyber Operations</span></span>/<span class="tooltip-trigger">OCO<span class="tooltip-inline">Offensive Cyber Operations</span></span> expertise, and a senior enlisted leader who's built secure architectures and cyber ranges from the ground up.</p>
          <p>We think holistically in <strong><span class="tooltip-trigger">DOTMLPF-P<span class="tooltip-inline">Doctrine, Organization, Training, Materiel, Leadership, Personnel, Facilities, Policy</span></span></strong> terms—understanding that effective cybersecurity requires alignment across:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Doctrine</strong> - Policies, procedures, and operational frameworks</li>
            <li><strong>Organization</strong> - Structure, roles, and responsibilities</li>
            <li><strong>Training</strong> - Skills development and knowledge transfer</li>
            <li><strong>Materiel</strong> - Tools, platforms, and technology solutions</li>
            <li><strong>Leadership</strong> - Strategic direction and decision-making</li>
            <li><strong>Personnel</strong> - Talent acquisition and team development</li>
            <li><strong>Facilities</strong> - Infrastructure and physical security</li>
            <li><strong>Policy</strong> - Governance, compliance, and regulatory alignment</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="section-image-wrapper">
          <img src="/images/site/team-ops.jpg" alt="Fighting Smart Cyber team in operations center" class="section-image" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section-alt">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="content-with-illustration reverse">
        <div class="content-text">
          <h2>Our Mission</h2>
          <p style="font-size: 24px; font-style: italic; color: var(--primary-blue); margin-bottom: 30px; font-weight: 600;">"Fight smarter by thinking like an operator."</p>
          <p>We help network owners, <span class="tooltip-trigger">CISOs<span class="tooltip-inline">Chief Information Security Officers</span></span>, IT leaders, and mission owners across on-prem, virtual, cloud, and hybrid networks identify operational gaps in their cyber posture and design solutions that work in the real world.</p>
          <h3 style="margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 20px;">What Makes Us Different</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Real operators, not career theorists</strong> - We've been in the trenches</li>
            <li><strong>Experience in both offense and defense</strong> - We know how attackers think</li>
            <li><strong>Ability to bridge policy, acquisition, technology, and execution</strong> - We speak all languages</li>
            <li><strong>Production-ready solutions</strong> - We deploy full stacks that work</li>
            <li><strong><span class="tooltip-trigger">TS/SCI<span class="tooltip-inline">Top Secret / Sensitive Compartmented Information</span></span>-level experience</strong> - We've operated at the highest levels</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section-alt dark-bg">
    <div class="container">
      <SectionHeader
        title="Our Approach"
        description="We take a holistic, operator-first approach to cybersecurity"
      />
      <div class="feature-grid">
        <FeatureItem
          title="Operational Focus"
          description="Every solution is designed with real-world operations in mind. We don't build theoretical frameworks—we build capabilities that work under pressure."
        />
        <FeatureItem
          title="Holistic Thinking"
          description="We evaluate cybersecurity through the DOTMLPF-P lens, ensuring all aspects of your organization are aligned for effective defense."
        />
        <FeatureItem
          title="Practitioner-Led"
          description="Our training and solutions are based on actual tactics, techniques, and procedures used in real operations, not textbook scenarios."
        />
        <FeatureItem
          title="Production-Ready"
          description="We don't deliver proof-of-concepts. We deliver turnkey platforms and solutions that are ready for production deployment."
        />
        <FeatureItem
          title="Multi-Environment"
          description="Our solutions work across cloud, on-premises, hybrid, and air-gapped environments. We understand that one size doesn't fit all."
        />
        <FeatureItem
          title="Knowledge Transfer"
          description="We don't just deliver solutions—we train your team to operate and maintain them, ensuring long-term success."
        />
        <FeatureItem
          title="Threat-Informed Defense"
          description={`Our offensive experience shapes our defensive strategies. We build defenses that address real adversary <span class="tooltip-trigger">TTPs<span class="tooltip-inline">Tactics, Techniques, and Procedures</span></span>, not theoretical vulnerabilities.`}
        />
        <FeatureItem
          title="Mission Assurance"
          description="We focus on protecting the mission, not just the network. Every capability we deliver is measured against its impact on operational readiness and continuity."
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container">
      <SectionHeader title="Our Key Differentiators" />
      <div class="content-grid">
        <div class="content-text">
          <h3>Operator-Led</h3>
          <p>Built by practitioners who've done the mission, not just consulted on it. Our team has commanded, planned, and executed cyber operations at the highest levels.</p>
          <h3 style="margin-top: 40px;">Full Transparency & Trust</h3>
          <p>No black boxes. Open communication, earn confidence through visibility. We believe in showing our work and building trust through honest, straightforward partnerships.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="content-text">
          <h3>Fast-to-Ship</h3>
          <p>Velocity matters. We deliver working capability quickly and iterate in the open. No months-long discovery phases before you see real results.</p>
          <h3 style="margin-top: 40px;">Common Sense Approach</h3>
          <p>Cut through bureaucratic overhead and focus on what actually works. We strip away unnecessary complexity and deliver solutions that solve real problems.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</ContentPageLayout>
